and his face just lit up.

00:46:22.160 --> 00:46:23.250
- Oh really?

00:46:23.250 --> 00:46:25.357
- And he was like, "What?
Plugging in the whole way?"

00:46:25.357 --> 00:46:27.360
And I said, "Yeah, no, we really did."

00:46:27.360 --> 00:46:29.130
And he goes, "What was it like?"

00:46:29.130 --> 00:46:33.650
He said the transition
between fuel and energy,

00:46:33.650 --> 00:46:35.850
you know, is very different.

00:46:35.850 --> 00:46:36.683
And I said, "Yeah, no."

00:46:36.683 --> 00:46:40.730
I said, "It's been a real mind reset."

00:46:40.730 --> 00:46:43.210
- Yeah.
- And he was just

00:46:43.210 --> 00:46:44.960
super blown away by, I mean.

00:46:44.960 --> 00:46:47.420
He just said, "God, you lucky people."

00:46:47.420 --> 00:46:48.253
- Oh, that's nice.

00:46:48.253 --> 00:46:52.250
- And so I was thinking we so are lucky.

00:46:52.250 --> 00:46:54.040
- Yeah, no, no, no, it's true.
- It's just extraordinary.

00:46:54.040 --> 00:46:54.873
- We are.

00:46:54.873 --> 00:46:56.343
With these amazing motorbikes,

00:46:57.370 --> 00:46:59.670
