00:48:22.218 --> 00:48:24.852
(laughs) That was a bad one.

00:48:24.852 --> 00:48:26.429
(man gags)

00:48:26.429 --> 00:48:29.090
(man laughs)

00:48:29.090 --> 00:48:30.210
What was that donkey?

00:48:30.210 --> 00:48:31.173
- The donkey, yeah.

00:48:31.173 --> 00:48:33.212
- That was really smelly.

00:48:33.212 --> 00:48:35.462
(man gags)

00:48:39.994 --> 00:48:41.087
- Very nice.

00:48:41.087 --> 00:48:42.650
- It's beautiful.

00:48:42.650 --> 00:48:45.317
(wind rustling)

00:51:50.650 --> 00:51:52.183
- How many miles have we got to go?

00:51:53.490 --> 00:51:54.323
- Um...

00:51:56.310 --> 00:51:57.143
89.

