00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:54.033
- Yeah.

00:55:55.070 --> 00:55:57.540
They're just going down to
dump them in that place.

00:55:57.540 --> 00:56:00.443
- Yeah, probably empty
there into the mount.

00:56:05.110 --> 00:56:07.460
- 70 miles to go.
- Okay.

00:56:07.460 --> 00:56:09.220
Well, I think that town, I can't remember

00:56:09.220 --> 00:56:11.192
