00:56:11.192 --> 00:56:15.549
- It's about 30 mile, 25
mile, 20 mile, 30 miles short.

00:56:15.549 --> 00:56:16.540
- Okay.

00:56:16.540 --> 00:56:18.020
- 20 odd miles short.

00:56:18.020 --> 00:56:19.680
- And that's where your-

00:56:19.680 --> 00:56:21.710
- That's where the pizza place was.

00:56:21.710 --> 00:56:23.690
- So that's 50 miles away.

00:56:23.690 --> 00:56:25.015
- Yeah.

00:56:25.015 --> 00:56:27.066
- And now I've only got
44 miles on my bike,

00:56:27.066 --> 00:56:28.500
but then I'm going up a hill.

00:56:28.500 --> 00:56:30.010
- Yeah, and we've got 50%,

00:56:30.010 --> 00:56:33.910
so we've already done about 60 miles.

00:56:33.910 --> 00:56:35.200
- Right.
- Today, because it was

00:56:35.200 --> 00:56:37.470
140 altogether, wasn't it?

00:56:37.470 --> 00:56:38.303
- Yeah.

00:56:38.303 --> 00:56:42.713
- So, we've done sort of half, really.

00:56:46.040 --> 00:56:48.930
- Yeah, if we got 50 miles left.

00:56:48.930 --> 00:56:52.090
So, I've got 70 miles to the hotel,

00:56:52.090 --> 00:56:53.960
then 50 miles must be to that

00:56:53.960 --> 00:56:56.169
place-ish.
- Yeah.

00:56:56.169 --> 00:56:58.836
(wind rustling)

00:58:09.813 --> 00:58:12.463
