00:58:17.420 --> 00:58:18.333
- Yeah, yeah.

00:58:24.345 --> 00:58:26.220
- I have to say, I'm so glad
we're riding it, though.

00:58:26.220 --> 00:58:29.860
I mean, it's what we're
here for, it's so cool.

00:58:29.860 --> 00:58:33.240
- Yeah, no, it's a much better plan than-

00:58:33.240 --> 00:58:37.536
